              "// Moi lan chay tao 1 email moi de khong bi trung (409)\r\npm.environment.set(\"testEmail\", \"postman.\" + Date.now() + \"@example.com\");\r\npm.environment.set(\"testPassword\", \"Postman@12345\");\r\n"
